UID:10003025-1793302200-1793309400@visitdavis.org
SUMMARY:Tim McNary Live @ The Melon Ball
DESCRIPTION:Tim McNary Live @ The Melon Ball in Davis \nTim McNary is a Cinematic Folk Artist from the Southern United States. He found his passion for songwriting while backpacking throughout South America after college. The Nashville based songwriter traverses emotional and geographical borders with multi-dimensional songwriting and evocative  vocals. Some of his musical influences include Ben Howard\, Foy Vance\, & Leif Vollebekk. He’s had dozens of  film & tv placements\, collaborated with a host of recognized songwriters\, and toured extensively around the United States & Canada. \nListen to Tim on Spotify or Soundcloud\nLive Performance Snippets (YouTube)\nBack to the Beginning (Live – YouTube) \nTim’s Website and Instagram \n$20 General Admission\n$15 Students (in-store or at the door only\, w/ID)\n$15 Kids under 12 (in-store or at the door only) \nDoors open at 7:00pm\nThis is a BYOB event!
URL:https://visitdavis.org/event/tim-mcnary-live-the-melon-ball/
LOCATION:The Melon Ball – Watermelon Music\, 1970 Lake Blvd.\, Davis\, CA\, 95616\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://visitdavis.org/wp-content/uploads/TimMcNaryWeb-1myOTC.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Watermelon Music":MAILTO:info@watermelonmusic.com
END:VEVENT
